			<!-- Slider -->
			<section><h2>#22</h2><img data-src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2023/02/MDW-400x400.png" alt="#22" /><div>A NEW PERSPECTIVE</div><div>DISCOVER ALL PRODUCTS</div><a href="https://www.henge07.com/products/">Discover</a></section>
			<!-- /Slider -->

			<!-- Banner Home -->
			<section><h2>Timeless Tables</h2><div><p>Sisma, a table of great versatility, stems from the harmonious visual interplay between the generously proportioned concave and convex forms of its skillfully shaped and hand-chiseled legs.</p></div><a href="https://www.henge07.com/products/tables/">Discover</a></section>
			<!-- /Banner Home -->

			<!-- First Banner -->
			<section><img src="" alt="icon" /><h3>FLAGSHIP</h3><h2>HENGE MIAMI</h2><p>Henge consolidates its presence in the United States with a flagship store in the heart of Miami. Nestled in the vibrant Design District, the 350-square-metre space celebrates Henge’s distinctive aesthetic and design philosophy, where unique materials and timeless craftsmanship blend seamlessly with contemporary, visionary design.<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span></p>
<p>The showroom is conceived as a true “design atelier”, offering architects, designers, and design enthusiasts an immersive experience into the world of Henge. The collections on display include iconic pieces alongside new releases, presented within an interior concept defined by striking contrasts and a masterful balance of materials. Every piece is handcrafted in Italy using carefully selected materials and exclusive artisanal techniques.</p>
<img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2024/12/DSC05856-Migliorato-NR.jpg" alt="HENGE MIAMI" /><a href="https://www.henge07.com/showroom/showroom-henge-miami/">Discover</a></section>
			<!-- /First Banner -->

			<!-- Video Section -->
			<section><video src="h" /><video src="h" /><p>Milan Design Week</p></section>
			<!-- /Video Section -->


			<!-- Catalogue Section -->
			<section><img src="" alt="icon" /><h3>HENGE CATALOGUE</h3><h2>UNWRITTEN STREETS</h2><img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2025/07/BOOK-S344-MOCKUP-630x850-1.jpg" alt="UNWRITTEN STREETS" /><a href=""></a></section>
			<!-- /Catalogue Sectionr -->

			<!-- Second Banner -->
			<section><img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2023/04/hk_logo.png" alt="icon" /><h2>Henge kitchens</h2><p class="p1"><span class="s1">HK is the result of the interior design experience, coming from real houses projects and the awareness that the kitchen and the dining areas are the heart of the house, the core, a place of family and public conviviality. </span></p>
<img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2023/04/Oneon_02_2.jpg" alt="Henge kitchens" /><a href="https://www.henge07.com/products/kitchens/">Discover</a></section>
			<!-- /Second Banner -->

			<!-- Third Banner -->
			<section><img src="" alt="icon" /><h3>HENGE PROJECTS</h3><h2>Villa Cannes</h2><img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2023/10/hg1536.jpeg" alt="Villa Cannes" /><a href="https://www.henge07.com/project/villa-cannes/">Discover</a></section>
			<!-- /Third Banner -->

			<!-- Fourth Banner -->
			<section><img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2023/01/H-Life.png" alt="icon" /><h2>Henge Paris</h2><p>Following its experience at Design Miami, Henge opens its first pop-up store in Paris: a space created in partnership with Silvera, a leading reference for contemporary design in France.</p>
<p>A temporary project conceived as an immersive environment, blending the timeless allure of the French capital with the material research and sophisticated approach that have always defined Henge’s identity.</p>
<img src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2026/01/10-scaled.jpg" alt="Henge Paris" /><a href="https://www.henge07.com/hlife/henge-paris/">Henge Paris</a></section>
			<!-- /Fourth Banner -->

			<!-- Home Carousel -->
			<div><a href="https://www.henge07.com/hlife/breccia-medicea-dellacqua-santa/"><img data-src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2022/06/he1408m-400x400.jpg" alt="Breccia Medicea" /></a></div>
<div><a href="https://www.henge07.com/news/milan-design-week-2022"><img data-src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2022/05/he1420m-copia-400x400.jpg" alt="MDW 2022" /></a></div>
<div><a href="https://www.henge07.com/news/a-new-lab-where-henge-design-merged-with-journalism-and-sport/"><img data-src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2022/03/DSC00935-400x400.jpg" alt="OFF-ROAD" /></a></div>
<div><a href="https://www.henge07.com/news/henge-beijing/"><img data-src="https://www.henge07.com/app/uploads/2021/12/005web-1-400x400.jpg" alt="HENGE BEIJING" /></a></div>
